  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Strategic Planning**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the initial phase of planning. I\'ve broken it down into interactive clarification and an interview process. Turn one focuses on targeted multiple-choice questions via the `ask_question` tool, yielding after questions are asked, and importantly, holding off on creating that implementation plan just yet.\n\n\n**Aligning Runtime Architectures**\n\nI\'m now focusing on runtime alignment. There\'s a critical mismatch to address: the user\'s Next.js and FastAPI monorepo request versus the React/Vite/Express environment. I will avoid immediate scaffold generation, and instead, identify necessary architectural choices with the user via a structured questioning strategy. I\'ll need to figure out how to maintain a live preview.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Interactive Preview**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on an interactive, live split-screen workspace directly within the React + Vite + Express application. My plan involves immediate user interaction in the preview environment. I\'m considering providing the FastAPI + Pydantic v2 backend blueprints, or implementing the API directly in Express. I will get user input to find out how to best integrate the map engine.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_7109712048266097052"
      name: "ask_question"
      arguments_json: "{\"questions\":[{\"is_multi_select\":false, \"options\":[\"(Recommended) Live React + Express app with FastAPI/Pydantic models\", \"Strict Next.js + FastAPI monorepo files only\", \"Live React + Vite UI with Express API only\"], \"question\":\"This workspace runs React + Vite + Express on port 3000. How should we structure Astris Travel so your preview works immediately?\"}, {\"is_multi_select\":false, \"options\":[\"(Recommended) Token-free MapLibre GL with great-circle arcs\", \"Mapbox GL with environment token configuration\", \"Google Maps Platform integration\"], \"question\":\"Mapbox GL requires a private access token to load map tiles. Which mapping setup do you prefer for the interactive world map?\"}, {\"is_multi_select\":false, \"options\":[\"(Recommended) Full interactive split-screen workspace with mock dataset\", \"Models, schemas, and minimal preview shell only\"], \"question\":\"For this build, how complete should the interactive timeline, Smart Score engine, and voucher matcher be?\"}, {\"is_multi_select\":false, \"options\":[\"(Recommended) Mock dataset + Express API endpoints first\", \"Set up PostgreSQL database persistence immediately\"], \"question\":\"How should trip data and transit options be stored in this initial phase?\"}], \"toolAction\":\"Asking clarifying architecture questions\", \"toolSummary\":\"Ask clarifying questions\"}"
