            lines {
              text: "- **Confirmed Decision 1 \342\200\224 Hybrid Live Runtime + FastAPI Schemas**: Build a live, immediately previewable React + Vite + Express TypeScript application on port 3000 while also delivering the shared TypeScript contracts and Python FastAPI + Pydantic v2 models (`Trip`, `TripLeg`, `TransitOption`, `Voucher`) alongside the structured JSON mock dataset."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Confirmed Decision 2 \342\200\224 Token-Free MapLibre GL**: Use `react-map-gl` (MapLibre entrypoint) paired with `maplibre-gl` and `@turf/great-circle` over a clean, token-free Carto Positron vector/raster basemap so numbered destination pins and curved geodesic flight arcs render reliably with zero API key friction."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Confirmed Decision 3 \342\200\224 Full Interactive Workspace**: Ship the complete split-screen workspace upfront, including drag-and-drop stop reordering, adding/removing destinations, live Smart Score recalculation, two-stage route optimization, and interactive voucher application."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
