  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining User Interface**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the UI. Replacing the hourly slider with a 3-tier preset toggle (\"Budget Backpacker\", \"Standard Traveler\", \"Luxury Explorer\") and accompanying price displays feels more intuitive. The \"pain multipliers\" for the VTTS model will be cleverly integrated. My aim is to make the experience smooth, with the cost-benefit analysis easily accessible. This will affect `implementation_plan.md`.\n\n\n**Calculating Smart Score**\n\nI\'ve been working on the smart score calculation. I\'ve defined new multipliers for different travel modes and layover durations. In-vehicle travel uses a base rate, and overnight sleepers get a discount. Layovers are now clearly defined, with multipliers based on their length. The formula integrates these factors, resulting in the following: smartScore = discountedPrice + (inVehicleHours * baseRate * modeMultiplier) + (layoverHours * baseRate * layoverMultiplier). I will be sure to avoid code modifications.\n\n\n"
