  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining the VTTS Model**\n\nI\'m currently updating `implementation_plan.md` using `multi_replace_file_content`. The focus is a clean integration of the tiered VTTS model. Specifically, I\'m setting the rates for each tier: \"Budget Backpacker\" at $5/hr, \"Balanced Explorer\" at $15/hr (default), and \"Time-Rich / Express\" at $35/hr.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_14885716602193795655"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"ArtifactMetadata\":{\"RequestFeedback\":true, \"Summary\":\"Revised implementation plan for Astris Travel incorporating the 3-tier Value of Travel Time Savings (VTTS) preset toggle ($5/$15/$35 per hr) with optional advanced fine-tuning slider and the weighted Smart Score formula with overnight sleeper (0.4x) and layover pain multipliers (1.5x normal, 2.5x long).\", \"UserFacing\":true}, \"Description\":\"Update Smart Score algorithm and UI controls to use tiered VTTS presets ($5/hr, $15/hr default, $35/hr) + optional advanced slider and weighted comfort/pain multipliers.\", \"Instruction\":\"Revise Smart Score UI controls, formula, architecture diagram, and TransitOption data model in implementation_plan.md.\", \"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":24, \"ReplacementContent\":\"- **Key Value**: Eliminates multi-tab spreadsheet planning by quantifying the true comfort-weighted, time-adjusted cost of every leg (`discountedPrice + (inVehicleHours \303\227 baseRate \303\227 modeMultiplier) + (layoverHours \303\227 baseRate \303\227 layoverMultiplier)`) and immediately visualizing route geometry and savings on one canvas.\", \"StartLine\":23, \"TargetContent\":\"- **Key Value**: Eliminates multi-tab spreadsheet planning by quantifying the true time-adjusted cost of every leg (`Price + (Travel & Layover Hours \303\227 Hourly Time Value)`) and immediately visualizing route geometry and savings on one canvas.\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":33, \"ReplacementContent\":\"  1. **Initial Workspace Load**: Opens directly into the pre-loaded 4-stop trip (`1. Kuala Lumpur \342\206\222 2. Istanbul \342\206\222 3. London \342\206\222 4. Paris`), displaying total trip cost, total travel hours, the active **Balanced Explorer (`$15/hr`)** VTTS tier, and numbered geodesic arcs across Asia and Europe.\\n  2. **Timeline & Map Synchronization**: Users drag stops by their grip handle to reorder the sequence, hover over any stop or leg to highlight its corresponding pin and curved arc on the map, click a leg to inspect door-to-door flight/train/bus alternatives, or add/remove stops from a searchable destination picker.\\n  3. **Tiered VTTS Smart Score & Multi-Modal Filtering**: Switching between the 3-tier Value of Travel Time Savings (VTTS) preset toggle (**Budget Backpacker** `$5/hr`, **Balanced Explorer** `$15/hr` default, **Time-Rich / Express** `$35/hr`), optionally expanding the advanced fine-tuning slider, or toggling the floating glassmorphic transport filter bar (`All`, `Flight`, `Train`, `Bus`) over the map dynamically recalculates pain-weighted Smart Scores and re-ranks transit cards in real time.\", \"StartLine\":30, \"TargetContent\":\"  1. **Initial Workspace Load**: Opens directly into the pre-loaded 4-stop trip (`1. Kuala Lumpur \342\206\222 2. Istanbul \342\206\222 3. London \342\206\222 4. Paris`), displaying total trip cost, total travel hours, active Smart Score hourly valuation (`$45/hr` default), and numbered geodesic arcs across Asia and Europe.\\n  2. **Timeline & Map Synchronization**: Users drag stops by their grip handle to reorder the sequence, hover over any stop or leg to highlight its corresponding pin and curved arc on the map, click a leg to inspect door-to-door flight/train/bus alternatives, or add/remove stops from a searchable destination picker.\\n  3. **Smart Score & Multi-Modal Filtering**: Adjusting the **Time Value (`$/hr`)** slider or toggling the floating glassmorphic transport filter bar (`All`, `Flight`, `Train`, `Bus`) over the map dynamically recalculates Smart Scores and re-ranks transit cards in real time.\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":74, \"ReplacementContent\":\"- **Decision 3 \342\200\224 Tiered VTTS Smart Score Engine & Two-Stage Optimizer**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Compute interactive Smart Score updates instantaneously on the client when toggling the 3-tier VTTS preset (`$5/hr`, `$15/hr`, `$35/hr`) or scrubbing the optional advanced slider, using phase-weighted pain multipliers (`0.4\303\227` overnight sleeper, `1.0\303\227` standard in-vehicle or short transfer `<2h`, `1.5\303\227` normal layover `2\342\200\2235h`, `2.5\303\227` long layover `6+h`), while routing Two-Stage Route Optimization and Voucher Validation through dedicated Express `/api/*` endpoints.\\n  - *Why*: Realistic VTTS presets prevent unrealistic distortions on long-haul flights while rewarding sleeper trains and penalizing grueling 6+ hour airport layovers; client-side recalculation keeps preset/slider transitions instantaneous.\", \"StartLine\":71, \"TargetContent\":\"- **Decision 3 \342\200\224 Real-Time Client + Server Smart Score & Two-Stage Optimizer**:\\n  - *Chosen Approach*: Compute interactive Smart Score slider updates instantaneously in client state for zero-latency scrubbing, while routing Two-Stage Route Optimization and Voucher Validation through dedicated Express `/api/*` endpoints.\\n  - *Why*: Gives instant feedback when sliding Hourly Time Value while keeping route-permutation search and promo eligibility cleanly encapsulated in backend APIs.\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":96, \"ReplacementContent\":\"\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 Trip Summary & VTTS Tier Toggle \342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\202 Glassmorphic Filter Bar   \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 ($5/$15/$35 + Advanced Slider)  \342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\202 [All|Flight|Train|Bus]    \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202\", \"StartLine\":92, \"TargetContent\":\"\342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 Trip Summary & Time-Value Slider\342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\202 Glassmorphic Filter Bar   \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\202 ($/hr) + Add Destination Bar    \342\224\202  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\202 [All|Flight|Train|Bus]    \342\224\202  \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202 \342\224\202  \342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230  \342\224\202\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":117, \"ReplacementContent\":\"\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Weighted VTTS Engine: discountedPrice + inVehicle*(rate*modeMult)       \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202    + layover*(rate*layoverMult) [0.4x sleeper, 1.0x/1.5x/2.5x layover]    \342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Two-Stage Route Optimizer & Voucher Eligibility Matcher                \342\224\202\", \"StartLine\":115, \"TargetContent\":\"\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Smart Score Engine: price + ((travelHours + layoverHours) * hourlyRate)\342\224\202\\n\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Two-Stage Route Optimizer & Voucher Eligibility Matcher                \342\224\202\"}, {\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"EndLine\":132, \"ReplacementContent\":\"- **Data Model & State**:\\n  - **`Trip`**: Holds `id`, `title`, `currency`, `vttsTier` (`\'backpacker\' | \'explorer\' | \'express\' | \'custom\'`), `hourlyTimeValue` (`5`, `15` default, `35`, or custom slider value), ordered `stops` (each with `id`, `order`, `city`, `country`, `iataCode`, `lat`, `lng`, `stayNights`, `arrivalDate`, `departureDate`), and computed `legs`.\\n  - **`TripLeg`**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `fromStopId`, `toStopId`, `fromCity`, `toCity`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`).\\n  - **`TransitOption`**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\'`, `isOvernightSleeper`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `inVehicleHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `discountedPriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `smartScoreBreakdown`, `doorToDoorNotes`, `eligibleVoucherIds`).\\n  - **`Voucher`**: Promo rule (`id`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `expiresAt`, `description`).\\n  - **Shared Contracts**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime and mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 + FastAPI reference files.\\n\\n- **Interactive Component & State Mapping**:\\n  - *Stop Drag-and-Drop (`@dnd-kit/core` + `@dnd-kit/sortable`)*: Dropping a stop into a new position updates `stops` order, regenerates `TripLeg` pairs (`1\342\206\2222`, `2\342\206\2223`, `3\342\206\2224`), fetches/computes corridor transit options, and updates MapLibre GeoJSON great-circle arcs immediately.\\n  - *Hover & Selection Sync*: Hovering or clicking a stop or leg updates `hoveredStopId` / `activeLegId`, highlighting the corresponding pin and geodesic arc on MapLibre and smoothly panning the viewport.\\n  - *Tiered VTTS Preset Toggle, Advanced Slider & Mode Filter Bar*: Selecting **Budget Backpacker (`$5/hr`)**, **Balanced Explorer (`$15/hr`)**, or **Time-Rich / Express (`$35/hr`)**, fine-tuning via the collapsible advanced slider, or toggling `activeModeFilter` recomputes every option\'s weighted `smartScore` (`discountedPrice + inVehicleHours * baseRate * (isOvernightSleeper ? 0.4 : 1.0) + layoverHours * baseRate * layoverMultiplier`) and re-sorts visible cards per leg.\\n  - *Route Optimizer Modal/Drawer*: Invokes `POST /api/optimize-route`, displaying Stage 1 candidate permutations ranked by total great-circle km alongside Stage 2 transit-cost & weighted Smart Score comparisons, with an **Apply Optimized Order** action.\", \"StartLine\":120, \"TargetContent\":\"- **Data Model & State**:\\n  - **`Trip`**: Holds `id`, `title`, `currency`, `hourlyTimeValue`, ordered `stops` (each with `id`, `order`, `city`, `country`, `iataCode`, `lat`, `lng`, `stayNights`, `arrivalDate`, `departureDate`), and computed `legs`.\\n  - **`TripLeg`**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `fromStopId`, `toStopId`, `fromCity`, `toCity`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`).\\n  - **`TransitOption`**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\'`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `travelDurationHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `doorToDoorNotes`, `eligibleVoucherIds`).\\n  - **`Voucher`**: Promo rule (`id`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `expiresAt`, `description`).\\n  - **Shared Contracts**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime and mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 + FastAPI reference files.\\n\\n- **Interactive Component & State Mapping**:\\n  - *Stop Drag-and-Drop (`@dnd-kit/core` + `@dnd-kit/sortable`)*: Dropping a stop into a new position updates `stops` order, regenerates `TripLeg` pairs (`1\342\206\2222`, `2\342\206\2223`, `3\342\206\2224`), fetches/computes corridor transit options, and updates MapLibre GeoJSON great-circle arcs immediately.\\n  - *Hover & Selection Sync*: Hovering or clicking a stop or leg updates `hoveredStopId` / `activeLegId`, highlighting the corresponding pin and geodesic arc on MapLibre and smoothly panning the viewport.\\n  - *Hourly Time Value Slider & Mode Filter Bar*: Changing `hourlyTimeValue` or `activeModeFilter` recomputes every `TransitOption.smartScore` and re-sorts visible cards per leg.\\n  - *Route Optimizer Modal/Drawer*: Invokes `POST /api/optimize-route`, displaying Stage 1 candidate permutations ranked by total great-circle km alongside Stage 2 transit-cost & Smart Score comparisons, with an **Apply Optimized Order** action.\"}], \"TargetFile\":\"/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/fb7c045e-904d-498c-ad70-52c85fbc80f0/implementation_plan.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating implementation plan with tiered VTTS Smart Score\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update implementation plan\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\224\a\n\221\a\001i\024}\023\257\203d\321\360m\372\272Q\253\035Y\302\222O\371\001\331\345f\f\260\216_L\177\023H\304\232\277h\2079Nc\376\302\342\274\032\374<\220\257\v\317!c\245m\302G*\304n\341un}\022\022\032x\335\270\230\200\262\330\031\300G`\r\216\327\334M(U\312@z\033\264\337P\306\277\261\315zk5\260\271f\030h;\216\005)\346(-6\212\315I\272hl\300$\0375\376\326W]\255\324ZW\264z\221\006 B\325\345!\000\246h{\277]\367c\215\220\036 \273h}\302\341(\346\226\034\311$,9Y#(\311bCD\253\317^\337\237\226e\333\033\250T\355b=7\276\357\277\310\t}\371\303w\247\251\256\362\223\2666\376\317\370J\236\225\002\231\3055\b\207h\225\020V\216`7\341\307\345Z\201i\'\377GZ\017%\343\377\004\367\237\220\372\037\325\022\220\257\326\224\271\325 Lha\005\367\346\355=\226>\323d\b/EMFuh\203\265\264\363\312\337\024\345\025I\365K`~m\321T8\334\350y\337\311>e\310\256\253$F.aS\273|\255\2663\027\274\225}\230\2578\035ss\372}D\245\361\200\r6\360\032Q^\342\306\256\022\'\225\267X\350\365LD-y\301\311\201\253\265_y@\252^\334 p\215\373\005|@\372f\024)\362\333\'\303\264R\005\022b\223\027n\272*\025M\370\210\322T$\233b\372\271\360\365 \354\371\301\034\322\345\323~x\\1\347\221i\037\353\307\324\033\254\205!\270\350\275\276m\220\262\265\377\020\354\324\224I=\326\036\324\371z\232\301s\370\025R\311\000\261\032\314\234\271\353v\310\2757\247?\307V6\264\233\nZ\324+\r\272B\213\312=\274i8\257\035dqz\365\314\223\253\363\243`g\251\223\311\3341\306\353T)\344g4\006\vF\321\207v\374v^\225\241\314\306\217@\224\273I\204\350\261\a\315\340\254\200M\341\315\321O$/\253\f\201\203\006\230\363 \332\226\267i\271\301\366\241\033\232c\277\376\202\313XDC?\036~\361:S\r\340\227\310RUw\000\211er_K\312\3630]\320_\301OnO\300\356zR\001Z\022M=\356{\221\317\260\342\213U\016U\036\203\210\315CR\022\340\274C\365\214\252 aM\316\364\r\276\272\033\3548\021~\340\004|*\r\275\234\201o\230A\371L\312\263\202I\316\244\a\264\224\024F\021\312\202N)z\2233\246Z77\223\031\235\375\325\017\330\032\275\000\365\001\251\362\251c\301/B\276lC\364\357d8\330U\236\367t\035\034}\212\332t)\216%\231\3167V\031\313~6\346RF\317\367\2115\273|%\017\020$\020\251\210$ \267\321\262\320\217\aT1\247\005!;q,\035\r<\241\214^\3306\246\332f\362V\3768\003\365\252GC\211\244\234\326\r\017\000\320s\022\374Y\265\250W\004z\021/\022W\212\222S\356\326\210\301>p\334\245\201\0165\377\315\227~\3036\250\265\362P^N\334\224.uH9\266\275d\341y\252\303+\257v\377\311\254\266\270\244~v\260h3\0321\006\271Z\030\361k\"s\314\365\327-\271\236\366\205M\033p\302\320\272\b\207\022l\r\354\310k\327\352\372_\323c\360R\377\230[\303\aQ\320\bsr\253\021\\\324M\277\265\320\210[\241?N\3704\266\a\351\241\326G"
