            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Data Model & State**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`Trip`**: Holds `id`, `title`, `currency`, `hourlyTimeValue`, ordered `stops` (each with `id`, `order`, `city`, `country`, `iataCode`, `lat`, `lng`, `stayNights`, `arrivalDate`, `departureDate`), and computed `legs`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`Trip`**: Holds `id`, `title`, `currency`, `vttsTier` (`\'backpacker\' | \'explorer\' | \'express\' | \'custom\'`), `hourlyTimeValue` (`5`, `15` default, `35`, or custom slider value), ordered `stops` (each with `id`, `order`, `city`, `country`, `iataCode`, `lat`, `lng`, `stayNights`, `arrivalDate`, `departureDate`), and computed `legs`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`TripLeg`**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `fromStopId`, `toStopId`, `fromCity`, `toCity`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`TransitOption`**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\'`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `travelDurationHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `doorToDoorNotes`, `eligibleVoucherIds`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`TransitOption`**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\'`, `isOvernightSleeper`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `inVehicleHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `discountedPriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `smartScoreBreakdown`, `doorToDoorNotes`, `eligibleVoucherIds`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`Voucher`**: Promo rule (`id`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `expiresAt`, `description`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Shared Contracts**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime and mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 + FastAPI reference files."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Interactive Component & State Mapping**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Stop Drag-and-Drop (`@dnd-kit/core` + `@dnd-kit/sortable`)*: Dropping a stop into a new position updates `stops` order, regenerates `TripLeg` pairs (`1\342\206\2222`, `2\342\206\2223`, `3\342\206\2224`), fetches/computes corridor transit options, and updates MapLibre GeoJSON great-circle arcs immediately."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Hover & Selection Sync*: Hovering or clicking a stop or leg updates `hoveredStopId` / `activeLegId`, highlighting the corresponding pin and geodesic arc on MapLibre and smoothly panning the viewport."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Hourly Time Value Slider & Mode Filter Bar*: Changing `hourlyTimeValue` or `activeModeFilter` recomputes every `TransitOption.smartScore` and re-sorts visible cards per leg."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Route Optimizer Modal/Drawer*: Invokes `POST /api/optimize-route`, displaying Stage 1 candidate permutations ranked by total great-circle km alongside Stage 2 transit-cost & Smart Score comparisons, with an **Apply Optimized Order** action."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Tiered VTTS Preset Toggle, Advanced Slider & Mode Filter Bar*: Selecting **Budget Backpacker (`$5/hr`)**, **Balanced Explorer (`$15/hr`)**, or **Time-Rich / Express (`$35/hr`)**, fine-tuning via the collapsible advanced slider, or toggling `activeModeFilter` recomputes every option\'s weighted `smartScore` (`discountedPrice + inVehicleHours * baseRate * (isOvernightSleeper ? 0.4 : 1.0) + layoverHours * baseRate * layoverMultiplier`) and re-sorts visible cards per leg."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Route Optimizer Modal/Drawer*: Invokes `POST /api/optimize-route`, displaying Stage 1 candidate permutations ranked by total great-circle km alongside Stage 2 transit-cost & weighted Smart Score comparisons, with an **Apply Optimized Order** action."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Voucher Toggle & Code Input*: Validates codes via `POST /api/vouchers/validate` or inline rule evaluation, updating discounted fare and net Smart Score across the leg and trip summary bar."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
          }
        }
