responsive stacked toggle on mobile).\n    - **Card & Metadata Restraint**: Single-elevation pure white `rounded-2xl` cards (`bg-white border border-neutral-200/80 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md`), active selection cards using `#FFF4ED` tint with `#FFD6BA` border, clean unboxed metadata joined by typographic separators (`\302\267`, `/`), and zero nested card-in-card clutter or thick left accent borders.\n    - **Map & Glassmorphic Controls**: Numbered destination pins (`1`, `2`, `3`, `4`...) and primary active flight/transit arcs rendered in `#FF812E` with soft white halos/outlines (`#FFFFFF`) on pins so they pop clearly against map tiles; floating segmented transport filter bar (`All`, `Flight`, `Train`, `Bus`) over the map styled with `bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/40 shadow-lg rounded-full`."
