            lines {
              text: "Astris Travel is a split-screen multi-destination travel planning and route optimization workspace that pairs an interactive drag-and-drop itinerary timeline with a synchronized geodesic world map, multi-modal transit comparison, Smart Score ranking, two-stage route optimization, and automatic voucher matching."
