  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `/src/components/` directory to begin building the React frontend. My focus is on creating a modular and visually elegant UI. I\'ve started with `/src/components/TopBar.tsx`, ensuring it strictly adheres to a three-zone contract with specifications like `gap-8` and `h-16`. My aim is meticulous adherence to all design and engineering guidelines.\n\n\n**Defining TopBar Specifications**\n\nI\'m deep into refining the `TopBar` component now. Zone 1 is locked in with the \"Astris Travel\" wordmark. Nav links are wired in Zone 2. My attention is currently on Zone 3, nailing down the \"Optimize Route\" CTA button\'s functionality. It should trigger the Two-Stage Global Route Optimizer. The component is taking shape, adhering to specs.\n\n\n**Refining Trip Optimization Controls**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the fine-grained controls for trip optimization. I\'ve designed three distinct cards in a columnar layout to maximize visual and interactive responsiveness: I will have: a **Time, Smart Score, Distance** selector; a 3-tier VTTS preset segmented toggle; and an optional \"Fine Tuning\" advanced slider. The latter provides a range slider and clearly displays pain multipliers to users, while collapsing when not needed. I\'m focusing on clean visual separation and intuitive interaction.\n\n\n**Detailing Stop UI Elements**\n\nI\'m now implementing stop UI elements. My focus includes the `#FF812E` color for pins, a drag grip, and comprehensive city/country/IATA display (`Kuala Lumpur \302\267 Malaysia \302\267 KUL`). I\'m adding a stay nights stepper and a remove button. I\'m aiming for clean metadata presentation separated by middle dots, and a hover state highlighting the corresponding map pin. I\'m also ensuring a reset button for clean states.\n\n\\n\\n\n\n**Designing LegTransitPanel**\n\nI\'m now detailing the LegTransitPanel. I\'m crafting a clear leg connector representation and a summary of the selected transit option. Clicking will expand to reveal multi-modal options sorted by Smart Score, filtered by map mode. Each option card will show clear mode icons, carrier details, and whether it\'s an overnight leg.\n\n\n**Elaborating Transit Panel**\n\nI\'m now detailing the LegTransitPanel further. I\'m focusing on the specifics for each option card. I\'ll include an overnight sleeper indicator with quiet text and the departure and arrival information. There\'s a section for station details and a note for door-to-door transfers. I\'m also implementing a Smart Score breakdown with toggle, transparent math and inline savings indicators. I\'m using active card styling for the selected transit and integrating with the WorldMapCanvas.\n\n\n**Visualizing Trip Routes**\n\nI\'m now implementing the route visualization on the map. I\'m focusing on rendering geodesic arcs for each leg in `#FF812E`, with varying line widths and opacities for base and active/hovered states. Destination pins will be numbered and interactive, providing city, dates, and stay details on hover. I\'m ensuring automatic map bounds fitting and smooth fly-to animations. I\'m also adding a glassmorphism transport filter bar.\n\n\n**Implementing Modal Interactions**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial modal components. A floating leg telemetry overlay on the map will display leg distance and carrier details, with a reset view button. I\'m building an AddStopModal for seamless hub catalog integration, RouteOptimizerModal for clear stage-by-stage optimization, and a VoucherDrawer for promo code management and savings display, all supporting interaction and backend APIs.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_9424004338359249376"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { Compass, Plus, Sparkles, Ticket } from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface TopBarProps {\\n  activePanel: \'timeline\' | \'smart-score\' | \'vouchers\';\\n  onSelectPanel: (panel: \'timeline\' | \'smart-score\' | \'vouchers\') => void;\\n  onOpenAddStop: () => void;\\n  onOpenVouchers: () => void;\\n  onOptimizeRoute: () => void;\\n  isOptimizing: boolean;\\n  activeVoucherCount: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport function TopBar({\\n  activePanel,\\n  onSelectPanel,\\n  onOpenAddStop,\\n  onOpenVouchers,\\n  onOptimizeRoute,\\n  isOptimizing,\\n  activeVoucherCount,\\n}: TopBarProps) {\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"h-16 bg-white border-b border-neutral-200/80 px-5 lg:px-7 flex items-center justify-between gap-8 shrink-0 z-30\\\">\\n      {/* Zone 1: Single-line Brand Wordmark */}\\n      <a\\n        href=\\\"#top\\\"\\n        onClick={(e) => {\\n          e.preventDefault();\\n          onSelectPanel(\'timeline\');\\n        }}\\n        className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#FF812E] rounded-lg\\\"\\n      >\\n        <span className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-[#FF812E] text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm\\\">\\n          <Compass className=\\\"w-4.5 h-4.5\\\" strokeWidth={2.25} />\\n        </span>\\n        <span className=\\\"font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-[#111827] whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n          Astris Travel\\n        </span>\\n      </a>\\n\\n      {/* Zone 2: Clean single-line text navigation links */}\\n      <nav\\n        aria-label=\\\"Primary workspace navigation\\\"\\n        className=\\\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-[#4B5563]\\\"\\n      >\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => onSelectPanel(\'timeline\')}\\n          className={`py-1.5 border-b-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n            activePanel === \'timeline\'\\n              ? \'border-[#FF812E] text-[#111827] font-semibold\'\\n              : \'border-transparent hover:text-[#111827]\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          Itinerary\\n        </button>\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={() => onSelectPanel(\'smart-score\')}\\n          className={`py-1.5 border-b-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer ${\\n            activePanel === \'smart-score\'\\n              ? \'border-[#FF812E] text-[#111827] font-semibold\'\\n              : \'border-transparent hover:text-[#111827]\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          Smart Score\\n        </button>\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={onOpenVouchers}\\n          className={`py-1.5 border-b-2 transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 ${\\n            activePanel === \'vouchers\'\\n              ? \'border-[#FF812E] text-[#111827] font-semibold\'\\n              : \'border-transparent hover:text-[#111827]\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          <Ticket className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#4B5563]\\\" />\\n          <span>Vouchers ({activeVoucherCount})</span>\\n        </button>\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={onOpenAddStop}\\n          className=\\\"py-1.5 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-[#111827] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\\\"\\n        >\\n          <Plus className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-[#4B5563]\\\" />\\n          <span>Add Stop</span>\\n        </button>\\n      </nav>\\n\\n      {/* Zone 3: Single Primary Action */}\\n      <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n        <button\\n          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n          onClick={onOptimizeRoute}\\n          disabled={isOptimizing}\\n          className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-[#FF812E] hover:bg-[#E56B1A] active:scale-[0.99] disabled:opacity-60 text-white text-sm font-semibold shadow-sm transition-all whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#FF812E] focus-visible:ring-offset-2\\\"\\n        >\\n          <Sparkles className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          <span>{isOptimizing ? \'Optimizing...\' : \'Optimize Route\'}</span>\\n        </button>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create 3-zone TopBar navigation component following the Top Bar Contract and Sunset Orange design system.\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/TopBar.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Creating TopBar navigation component\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create TopBar component\"}"
