  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Map Canvas**\n\nI\'m currently focused on building the `/src/components/WorldMapCanvas.tsx` component. I\'m leveraging Token-free MapLibre GL through `react-map-gl/maplibre`, incorporating `@turf/great-circle` for geodesic arcs. I\'m also implementing numbered pins in `#FF812E` with a soft white halo, using the `ring-4 ring-white` styling. This foundational element is key.\n\n\n"
