  planner_response {
    response: "**Astris Travel** has been built and is running live with the Sunset Orange (`#FF812E`) and Crisp White (`#FFFFFF`) split-screen workspace.\n\n### Implemented Features & Architecture\n\n- **Shared Data Models & Mock Dataset (TypeScript + Python FastAPI/Pydantic v2)**\n  - Defined aligned TypeScript contracts and Python Pydantic v2 schemas (`Trip`, `TripStop`, `TripLeg`, `TransitOption`, `SmartScoreBreakdown`, and `Voucher`), alongside the FastAPI backend reference router.\n  - Seeded the 4-stop **Eurasia Autumn Grand Tour** (`Kuala Lumpur \342\206\222 Istanbul \342\206\222 London \342\206\222 Paris`) with curated door-to-door flight, high-speed/sleeper rail, and intercity coach corridors, plus an expandable catalog of global hubs (`Dubai`, `Rome`, `Amsterdam`, `Singapore`).\n\n- **Synchronized Split-Screen Timeline & MapLibre GL Canvas**\n  - **Left Pane:** Drag-and-drop itinerary timeline powered by `@dnd-kit/core` and `@dnd-kit/sortable` with stay-night steppers, stop addition/removal, and expandable multi-modal transit comparison cards.\n  - **Right Pane:** Token-free MapLibre GL (`react-map-gl/maplibre`) map displaying `#FF812E` numbered pins with white halos, `@turf/great-circle` geodesic flight/transit arcs, hover/selection camera sync, and a floating glassmorphic transport filter bar (`All Modes`, `Flights`, `Trains`, `Buses`).\n\n- **Tiered VTTS Smart Score Engine**\n  - 3-tier traveler preset toggle (**Budget Backpacker** `$5/hr`, **Balanced Explorer** `$15/hr` default, **Time-Rich / Express** `$35/hr`) paired with a collapsible fine-tuning slider (`$0\342\200\223$80/hr`).\n  - Weighted formula factoring overnight sleepers (`0.4x`), standard travel (`1.0x`), 2\342\200\2235h layovers (`1.5x`), and 6h+ layovers (`2.5x`) with an inline cost breakdown on every transit option.\n\n- **Two-Stage Route Optimizer & Voucher Engine**\n  - Express `/api/optimize-route` endpoint evaluates geographical permutations in Stage 1 and scores top paths across multi-modal corridors in Stage 2, allowing one-click sequence updates.\n  - Interactive voucher drawer (`ASTRIS15`, `RAIL20`, `ISTHUB40`, `COACH10`) validates promo codes via `/api/vouchers/validate` and recalculates net fares and Smart Scores in real time.\n\n### Verification\n- Verified TypeScript typechecking (`tsc --noEmit`), production Vite build, dev server startup on port 3000, and live Express `/api/trips/default` and `/api/vouchers` responses."
    modified_response: "**Astris Travel** has been built and is running live with the Sunset Orange (`#FF812E`) and Crisp White (`#FFFFFF`) split-screen workspace.\n\n### Implemented Features & Architecture\n\n- **Shared Data Models & Mock Dataset (TypeScript + Python FastAPI/Pydantic v2)**\n  - Defined aligned TypeScript contracts and Python Pydantic v2 schemas (`Trip`, `TripStop`, `TripLeg`, `TransitOption`, `SmartScoreBreakdown`, and `Voucher`), alongside the FastAPI backend reference router.\n  - Seeded the 4-stop **Eurasia Autumn Grand Tour** (`Kuala Lumpur \342\206\222 Istanbul \342\206\222 London \342\206\222 Paris`) with curated door-to-door flight, high-speed/sleeper rail, and intercity coach corridors, plus an expandable catalog of global hubs (`Dubai`, `Rome`, `Amsterdam`, `Singapore`).\n\n- **Synchronized Split-Screen Timeline & MapLibre GL Canvas**\n  - **Left Pane:** Drag-and-drop itinerary timeline powered by `@dnd-kit/core` and `@dnd-kit/sortable` with stay-night steppers, stop addition/removal, and expandable multi-modal transit comparison cards.\n  - **Right Pane:** Token-free MapLibre GL (`react-map-gl/maplibre`) map displaying `#FF812E` numbered pins with white halos, `@turf/great-circle` geodesic flight/transit arcs, hover/selection camera sync, and a floating glassmorphic transport filter bar (`All Modes`, `Flights`, `Trains`, `Buses`).\n\n- **Tiered VTTS Smart Score Engine**\n  - 3-tier traveler preset toggle (**Budget Backpacker** `$5/hr`, **Balanced Explorer** `$15/hr` default, **Time-Rich / Express** `$35/hr`) paired with a collapsible fine-tuning slider (`$0\342\200\223$80/hr`).\n  - Weighted formula factoring overnight sleepers (`0.4x`), standard travel (`1.0x`), 2\342\200\2235h layovers (`1.5x`), and 6h+ layovers (`2.5x`) with an inline cost breakdown on every transit option.\n\n- **Two-Stage Route Optimizer & Voucher Engine**\n  - Express `/api/optimize-route` endpoint evaluates geographical permutations in Stage 1 and scores top paths across multi-modal corridors in Stage 2, allowing one-click sequence updates.\n  - Interactive voucher drawer (`ASTRIS15`, `RAIL20`, `ISTHUB40`, `COACH10`) validates promo codes via `/api/vouchers/validate` and recalculates net fares and Smart Scores in real time.\n\n### Verification\n- Verified TypeScript typechecking (`tsc --noEmit`), production Vite build, dev server startup on port 3000, and live Express `/api/trips/default` and `/api/vouchers` responses."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\277\003\n\274\003\001i\024}\023i\333}\032\300\300R\273\341+EV\241x7\332\261D\214\242\316\270\302\262\333Q5YZ\257M\213[\377?.\252&%\311\377\211\242\271DF\002\355G\177[\027\335n\273\274S\177\001\332\213\217\302L|b\254]\005\0225\017oN\3449\230V\203}&S\025\311\322R\301\307\032d6%\204\344H\037(\262p\305\005\027\206L\237K$\250D\270\340\355\310\027\306\253\225Y_g\231>\272+8\342]mk\214FX\264\262\016AN\216\213\347\223\273\037\366\t\023\317\000G\301U\206\372\036\223.\321\361\276\273\354+eG\246\323O\au\361\341\r\237\312r2Y \036p\203\233*N\375\2545$\036,\27276\253\201\022\323\203\351q\024\023\0257\334y\224\2758\260\026\3239\224\322\251\351\26776\266b\0248\324\030$.G\262\224\272ii\264\276%bm6\315~\230\305\233B\237\250Q\340#/\216\2003\230\200\322\0174Cw\230J\316\004b\002\321>\342\325\201\302\227~Q\364\031x\025\322U\347`>\252t.s\001\205\260\344943\334\251mSr\327\335va\232\002{\177\031[Wa\261N\361\341\255\324M\354\016\000\240D\306\026y)\370\033\311\a\b\350\033\250w\003\306/y\212\230Nu\245\331_\350\304/\217E\210\033L\360U\021\035x.xD\334\236s\000\337\004*\210\311]H\266\253i\242k\263\376}\004\321\360\f\303pL\v\365\255hi%\215\210\'\234\231\334\020\\\276w\333\325\340\325\204|\361\231\336\340\"\234h\267G\017\213\3261\366\vt\343\2438F\332\024\346\223\r"
