      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Document PostgreSQL relational schema tables and indexes in implementation_plan.md.\", \"EndLine\":125, \"Instruction\":\"Add PostgreSQL SCHEMA.sql alignment details to Data Model & State in implementation_plan.md.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"- **Data Model & State**:\\n  - **`UserProfile` (`users` table)**: Holds `id`, `email`, `fullName`, `preferredCurrency`, and `timeValuePerHour` (`$15.00` default for Smart Score VTTS math).\\n  - **`Trip` (`trips` table)**: Holds `id`, `userId`, `title`, `startDate`, `endDate`, `currency`, `isRouteOptimized`, `vttsTier` (`\'backpacker\' | \'explorer\' | \'express\' | \'custom\'`), `hourlyTimeValue` (`5`, `15` default, `35`, or custom slider value), ordered `stops`, and computed `legs`.\\n  - **`TripLeg` (`trip_legs` table)**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `tripId`, `orderIndex`, origin/destination city, code, `lat`/`lng`, `departureDate`, `nightsAtDestination`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`).\\n  - **`TransitOption` (`transit_options` table)**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `legId`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\' | \'ferry\'`, `isOvernightSleeper`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `inVehicleHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `discountedPriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `smartScoreBreakdown`, `bookingUrl`, `rawApiPayload`, `expiresAt`, `eligibleVoucherIds`).\\n  - **`Voucher` (`vouchers` table)**: Promo rule (`id`, `providerName`, `platformSource`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `maxDiscountUsd`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `validFrom`, `expiresAt`, `isActive`, `description`).\\n  - **Shared Contracts & PostgreSQL DDL**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime, mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 models, and backed by `SCHEMA.sql` with foreign key constraints and composite indexes (`idx_trip_legs_trip_order`, `idx_transit_options_leg_score`, `idx_vouchers_active_provider`) for future PostgreSQL persistence.\", \"StartLine\":116, \"TargetContent\":\"- **Data Model & State**:\\n  - **`Trip`**: Holds `id`, `title`, `currency`, `vttsTier` (`\'backpacker\' | \'explorer\' | \'express\' | \'custom\'`), `hourlyTimeValue` (`5`, `15` default, `35`, or custom slider value), ordered `stops` (each with `id`, `order`, `city`, `country`, `iataCode`, `lat`, `lng`, `stayNights`, `arrivalDate`, `departureDate`), and computed `legs`.\\n  - **`TripLeg`**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `fromStopId`, `toStopId`, `fromCity`, `toCity`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`).\\n  - **`TransitOption`**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\'`, `isOvernightSleeper`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `inVehicleHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `discountedPriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `smartScoreBreakdown`, `doorToDoorNotes`, `eligibleVoucherIds`).\\n  - **`Voucher`**: Promo rule (`id`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `expiresAt`, `description`).\\n  - **Shared Contracts**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime and mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 + FastAPI reference files.\", \"TargetFile\":\"/.aistudio/artifacts/brain/fb7c045e-904d-498c-ad70-52c85fbc80f0/implementation_plan.md\", \"toolAction\":\"Documenting PostgreSQL schema in plan\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update implementation plan\"}"
      original_name: "replace_file_content"
    }
