            lines {
              text: "\342\224\214\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\220"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202                Express API Server (Port 3000) & Shared Models             \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202                                                                           \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Shared TypeScript Contracts + FastAPI / Pydantic v2 Reference Models   \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Mock 4-Stop Dataset (Kuala Lumpur \342\206\222 Istanbul \342\206\222 London \342\206\222 Paris)         \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Weighted VTTS Engine: discountedPrice + inVehicle*(rate*modeMult)       \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202    + layover*(rate*layoverMult) [0.4x sleeper, 1.0x/1.5x/2.5x layover]    \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\202  \342\200\242 Two-Stage Route Optimizer & Voucher Eligibility Matcher                \342\224\202"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "\342\224\224\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\200\342\224\230"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "```"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Data Model & State**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`Trip`**: Holds `id`, `title`, `currency`, `vttsTier` (`\'backpacker\' | \'explorer\' | \'express\' | \'custom\'`), `hourlyTimeValue` (`5`, `15` default, `35`, or custom slider value), ordered `stops` (each with `id`, `order`, `city`, `country`, `iataCode`, `lat`, `lng`, `stayNights`, `arrivalDate`, `departureDate`), and computed `legs`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`TripLeg`**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `fromStopId`, `toStopId`, `fromCity`, `toCity`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`TransitOption`**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\'`, `isOvernightSleeper`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `inVehicleHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `discountedPriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `smartScoreBreakdown`, `doorToDoorNotes`, `eligibleVoucherIds`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`Voucher`**: Promo rule (`id`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `expiresAt`, `description`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Shared Contracts**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime and mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 + FastAPI reference files."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_DELETE
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`UserProfile` (`users` table)**: Holds `id`, `email`, `fullName`, `preferredCurrency`, and `timeValuePerHour` (`$15.00` default for Smart Score VTTS math)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`Trip` (`trips` table)**: Holds `id`, `userId`, `title`, `startDate`, `endDate`, `currency`, `isRouteOptimized`, `vttsTier` (`\'backpacker\' | \'explorer\' | \'express\' | \'custom\'`), `hourlyTimeValue` (`5`, `15` default, `35`, or custom slider value), ordered `stops`, and computed `legs`."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`TripLeg` (`trip_legs` table)**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `tripId`, `orderIndex`, origin/destination city, code, `lat`/`lng`, `departureDate`, `nightsAtDestination`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`TransitOption` (`transit_options` table)**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `legId`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\' | \'ferry\'`, `isOvernightSleeper`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `inVehicleHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `discountedPriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `smartScoreBreakdown`, `bookingUrl`, `rawApiPayload`, `expiresAt`, `eligibleVoucherIds`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **`Voucher` (`vouchers` table)**: Promo rule (`id`, `providerName`, `platformSource`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `maxDiscountUsd`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `validFrom`, `expiresAt`, `isActive`, `description`)."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - **Shared Contracts & PostgreSQL DDL**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime, mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 models, and backed by `SCHEMA.sql` with foreign key constraints and composite indexes (`idx_trip_legs_trip_order`, `idx_transit_options_leg_score`, `idx_vouchers_active_provider`) for future PostgreSQL persistence."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "- **Interactive Component & State Mapping**:"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Stop Drag-and-Drop (`@dnd-kit/core` + `@dnd-kit/sortable`)*: Dropping a stop into a new position updates `stops` order, regenerates `TripLeg` pairs (`1\342\206\2222`, `2\342\206\2223`, `3\342\206\2224`), fetches/computes corridor transit options, and updates MapLibre GeoJSON great-circle arcs immediately."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Hover & Selection Sync*: Hovering or clicking a stop or leg updates `hoveredStopId` / `activeLegId`, highlighting the corresponding pin and geodesic arc on MapLibre and smoothly panning the viewport."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Tiered VTTS Preset Toggle, Advanced Slider & Mode Filter Bar*: Selecting **Budget Backpacker (`$5/hr`)**, **Balanced Explorer (`$15/hr`)**, or **Time-Rich / Express (`$35/hr`)**, fine-tuning via the collapsible advanced slider, or toggling `activeModeFilter` recomputes every option\'s weighted `smartScore` (`discountedPrice + inVehicleHours * baseRate * (isOvernightSleeper ? 0.4 : 1.0) + layoverHours * baseRate * layoverMultiplier`) and re-sorts visible cards per leg."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Route Optimizer Modal/Drawer*: Invokes `POST /api/optimize-route`, displaying Stage 1 candidate permutations ranked by total great-circle km alongside Stage 2 transit-cost & weighted Smart Score comparisons, with an **Apply Optimized Order** action."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "  - *Voucher Toggle & Code Input*: Validates codes via `POST /api/vouchers/validate` or inline rule evaluation, updating discounted fare and net Smart Score across the leg and trip summary bar."
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
          }
        }
        absolute_uri: "file:///.aistudio/artifacts/brain/fb7c045e-904d-498c-ad70-52c85fbc80f0/implementation_plan.md"
      }
    }
    use_fast_apply: true
    replacement_infos {
      original_chunk {
        target_content: "- **Data Model & State**:\n  - **`Trip`**: Holds `id`, `title`, `currency`, `vttsTier` (`\'backpacker\' | \'explorer\' | \'express\' | \'custom\'`), `hourlyTimeValue` (`5`, `15` default, `35`, or custom slider value), ordered `stops` (each with `id`, `order`, `city`, `country`, `iataCode`, `lat`, `lng`, `stayNights`, `arrivalDate`, `departureDate`), and computed `legs`.\n  - **`TripLeg`**: Represents the corridor between stop $N$ and stop $N+1$ (`id`, `fromStopId`, `toStopId`, `fromCity`, `toCity`, `distanceKm`, `selectedOptionId`, `transitOptions`).\n  - **`TransitOption`**: Multi-modal candidate (`id`, `mode` `\'flight\' | \'train\' | \'bus\'`, `isOvernightSleeper`, `carrier`, `routeCode`, `originStation`, `destinationStation`, `departureTime`, `arrivalTime`, `inVehicleHours`, `layoverHours`, `stopsCount`, `basePriceUsd`, `discountedPriceUsd`, `smartScore`, `smartScoreBreakdown`, `doorToDoorNotes`, `eligibleVoucherIds`).\n  - **`Voucher`**: Promo rule (`id`, `code`, `title`, `discountType` `\'percentage\' | \'fixed\'`, `discountValue`, `minSpendUsd`, `applicableModes`, `applicableCarriers`, `expiresAt`, `description`).\n  - **Shared Contracts**: Identical schemas defined in TypeScript for client/Express runtime and mirrored in Python Pydantic v2 + FastAPI reference files."
