  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Discovering Map Tile Options**\n\nI\'ve found that `https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/positron` provides full OpenFreeMap vector tiles, sprites, and shaded relief without any API key or watermarks, which is fantastic! We can also continue using OSM raster tiles. This offers a compelling alternative for map integration.\n\n\n**Refining Transit Segment Data**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enriching our transit data. I\'m adding a `TransitSegment` interface and optional `segments` to `TransitOption` in `/shared/types.ts`. I\'m also updating `synthesizeCorridorOptions` to include realistic `segments` in synthesized corridors, mirroring real-world transit patterns in `/shared/smartScore.ts`. Finally, I\'m integrating realistic segment data with airport/station coordinates and multi-point waypoints into curated corridors in `/shared/mockDataset.ts`, ensuring map accuracy and realism. I\'m adding locations like KL Sentral and KLIA Terminal 1 to verify.\n\n\n**Expanding Global Transit Data**\n\nI\'m now incorporating detailed waypoint data for key international routes. I\'ve added geographic coordinates for major airports like Istanbul, Abu Dhabi, and London, alongside their respective city centers and transit hubs. I\'m also including detailed waypoints for Eurostar and Flixbus routes between London and Paris, enhancing the realism of long-distance options. My aim is to make our mock dataset more comprehensive, especially for long-haul routes.\n\n\n**Adding Route Waypoints**\n\nI\'ve just added detailed waypoints for the Balkan Nightjet and Eurostar routes between Istanbul and London. I also included Paris airports (CDG, ORY), and Paris Gare du Nord/Center. I\'m adding these routes for Istanbul to London, alongside coach polylines for FlixBus and BlaBlaCar Night Coach. This is helping me visualize the map elements. I am visualizing this as teal rail lines, sunset orange great-circle arcs, and royal purple ground coach polylines.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_10338879831641691154"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add TransitSegment interface and segments array to TransitOption in shared/types.ts.\", \"EndLine\":82, \"Instruction\":\"Add TransitSegment interface and optional segments field on TransitOption.\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"export interface TransitSegment {\\n  id: string;\\n  mode: TransitMode;\\n  label: string;\\n  fromName: string;\\n  fromCode: string;\\n  fromLat: number;\\n  fromLng: number;\\n  toName: string;\\n  toCode: string;\\n  toLat: number;\\n  toLng: number;\\n  durationMinutes: number;\\n  waypoints?: [number, number][]; // [lng, lat] intermediate stations/stops for ground polylines\\n}\\n\\nexport interface TransitOption {\\n  id: string;\\n  legId?: string;\\n  mode: TransitMode;\\n  isOvernightSleeper: boolean;\\n  carrier: string;\\n  carrierCode: string;\\n  routeCode: string;\\n  originStation: string;\\n  destinationStation: string;\\n  departureTime: string;\\n  arrivalTime: string;\\n  inVehicleHours: number;\\n  layoverHours: number;\\n  layoverHub?: string;\\n  stopsCount: number;\\n  basePriceUsd: number;\\n  discountedPriceUsd: number;\\n  smartScore: number;\\n  smartScoreBreakdown: SmartScoreBreakdown;\\n  doorToDoorNotes: string;\\n  co2Kg: number;\\n  bookingUrl?: string;\\n  expiresAt?: string;\\n  eligibleVoucherIds: string[];\\n  appliedVoucherId?: string | null;\\n  segments?: TransitSegment[];\\n}\", \"StartLine\":58, \"TargetContent\":\"export interface TransitOption {\\n  id: string;\\n  legId?: string;\\n  mode: TransitMode;\\n  isOvernightSleeper: boolean;\\n  carrier: string;\\n  carrierCode: string;\\n  routeCode: string;\\n  originStation: string;\\n  destinationStation: string;\\n  departureTime: string;\\n  arrivalTime: string;\\n  inVehicleHours: number;\\n  layoverHours: number;\\n  layoverHub?: string;\\n  stopsCount: number;\\n  basePriceUsd: number;\\n  discountedPriceUsd: number;\\n  smartScore: number;\\n  smartScoreBreakdown: SmartScoreBreakdo