  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Maplibre Changes**\n\nI see `maplibre-gl` v6.18.0 is out! I noticed that, with `maplibre-gl` v6 and ESM builds in Vite, `maplibre-gl.mjs` now creates a module worker pointing to `./maplibre-gl-worker.mjs` relative to `import.meta.url`. This is interesting; Vite\'s pre-bundling could be impacting this. This warrants further investigation into the implications.\n\n\n"
