  }
  planner_response {
    response: "Fixed the MapLibre GL Web Worker loading error (`Worker failed to load. Check that the worker URL is correct.`):\n\n- **Root Cause:** Vite\'s dependency pre-bundler places `maplibre-gl` inside `.vite/deps/` without copying `maplibre-gl-worker.mjs`, causing MapLibre\'s default relative worker URL lookup to 404.\n- **Fix Applied:** Imported `maplibre-gl/dist/maplibre-gl-worker.mjs?url` as a Vite asset URL, registered it via `setWorkerUrl(maplibreWorkerUrl)`, and passed `workerUrl={maplibreWorkerUrl}` directly to the `react-map-gl/maplibre` `<Map>` component so the exact MapLibre instance receives the resolved worker path in both dev and production builds.\n- **Verification:** Confirmed `tsc --noEmit`, `vite build` (emitting `dist/assets/maplibre-gl-worker-*.mjs`), dev server restart, and HTTP `200` `text/javascript` delivery for the worker module."
    modified_response: "Fixed the MapLibre GL Web Worker loading error (`Worker failed to load. Check that the worker URL is correct.`):\n\n- **Root Cause:** Vite\'s dependency pre-bundler places `maplibre-gl` inside `.vite/deps/` without copying `maplibre-gl-worker.mjs`, causing MapLibre\'s default relative worker URL lookup to 404.\n- **Fix Applied:** Imported `maplibre-gl/dist/maplibre-gl-worker.mjs?url` as a Vite asset URL, registered it via `setWorkerUrl(maplibreWorkerUrl)`, and passed `workerUrl={maplibreWorkerUrl}` directly to the `react-map-gl/maplibre` `<Map>` component so the exact MapLibre instance receives the resolved worker path in both dev and production builds.\n- **Verification:** Confirmed `tsc --noEmit`, `vite build` (emitting `dist/assets/maplibre-gl-worker-*.mjs`), dev server restart, and HTTP `200` `text/javascript` delivery for the worker module."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
