    modified_response: "Fixed the MapLibre GL Web Worker loading error:\n\n- **Cause:** Vite\'s dependency pre-bundling placed `maplibre-gl` inside `node_modules/.vite/deps/`, breaking MapLibre\'s default relative `./maplibre-gl-worker.mjs` lookup.\n- **Fix:** Imported `maplibre-gl/dist/maplibre-gl-worker.mjs?url` as a Vite asset URL, registered it via `setWorkerUrl(maplibreWorkerUrl)`, and passed `workerUrl={maplibreWorkerUrl}` directly to `<Map>` in `WorldMapCanvas`.\n- **Verification:** Confirmed `tsc --noEmit`, `vite build` (emitting the worker asset cleanly in `dist/assets/`), dev server restart on port 3000, and HTTP `200 text/javascript` serving of the worker script."
