    thinking: "**Checking a Subtle Edge Case**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on a potential issue within `MultiDestDatePickerModal.tsx`. Specifically, I\'m examining a scenario where `draftStartIso` is active, representing a user\'s selection for one destination, and how it interacts with another destination\'s previously scheduled start date. I want to ensure the logic handles overlapping date selections smoothly.\n\n\n**Analyzing Date Overlaps**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down on how `MultiDestDatePickerModal.tsx` handles date ranges, especially around `previewEndIso` and `draftStartIso`. I\'m focusing on the implications of a user extending a date range \342\200\223 like Nov 22 to Nov 26 \342\200\223 when there are existing stop dates, to ensure no conflicts. I\'m reviewing the lines of logic to ensure the logic works correctly, especially with `onUpdateStopDates` and `recalculateDatesAfterReorder`.\n\n\n"
