  planner_response {
    response: "Fixed date overlap collisions, transition-day rendering, and pill row clipping in the **Itinerary Dates** modal:\n\n- **Sequential Chaining & Overlap Prevention (`shared/dateUtils.ts`, `MultiDestDatePickerModal`):**\n  - Updated `updateStopDatesAndCascade` to clamp a stop\'s `arrivalDate` against the preceding stop\'s `departureDate` and sequentially cascade all subsequent stops forward/backward while preserving non-negative transit gaps.\n  - Disabled date cells earlier than the preceding stop\'s `departureDate` inside the calendar grid so stops can never overlap nights.\n- **Same-Day Handoff Rendering:** Added diagonal split-pill rendering (`departingColor \342\206\222 arrivingColor`) with crisp cap spacing (`ml-[2px]` / `mr-[2px]`) on transition days where one stop departs and the next stop arrives on the same date, eliminating ring and cap collisions.\n- **Top Pill Wrapping & Footer Alignment:** Replaced the horizontally scrolling tab strip with `flex-wrap gap-2` and compact `px-2.5 py-1` pills inside a `max-w-lg` modal so all destination tabs fit cleanly without right-edge clipping, and aligned the bottom legend and `Done` button on a single horizontal row (`flex items-center justify-between`).\n\n**Verification:** `npm run build` (`compile_applet`) and `tsc --noEmit` (`lint_applet`) passed with zero errors, and the dev server was restarted."
    modified_response: "Fixed date overlap collisions, transition-day rendering, and pill row clipping in the **Itinerary Dates** modal:\n\n- **Sequential Chaining & Overlap Prevention (`shared/dateUtils.ts`, `MultiDestDatePickerModal`):**\n  - Updated `updateStopDatesAndCascade` to clamp a stop\'s `arrivalDate` against the preceding stop\'s `departureDate` and sequentially cascade all subsequent stops forward/backward while preserving non-negative transit gaps.\n  - Disabled date cells earlier than the preceding stop\'s `departureDate` inside the calendar grid so stops can never overlap nights.\n- **Same-Day Handoff Rendering:** Added diagonal split-pill rendering (`departingColor \342\206\222 arrivingColor`) with crisp cap spacing (`ml-[2px]` / `mr-[2px]`) on transition days where one stop departs and the next stop arrives on the same date, eliminating ring and cap collisions.\n- **Top Pill Wrapping & Footer Alignment:** Replaced the horizontally scrolling tab strip with `flex-wrap gap-2` and compact `px-2.5 py-1` pills inside a `max-w-lg` modal so all destination tabs fit cleanly without right-edge clipping, and aligned the bottom legend and `Done` button on a single horizontal row (`flex items-center justify-between`).\n\n**Verification:** `npm run build` (`compile_applet`) and `tsc --noEmit` (`lint_applet`) passed with zero errors, and the dev server was restarted."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\227\001\n\224\001\001i\024}\023\t\v\220p*\037\332a\335\310\220-\356t\311\216\341\244\a,*q\341h\331\371D?\025\321-\332 6\236\353\203@!Z\262\335Y\314>`\304\347\035\245\016(8\327\024\320\304\026`\266\240\311\316\270\023\263\n((G\177H\274\3054\177\221\037\3556C&\215L\341\3340\225t\307\254U\3373A\332!\000\347\244\344\206\000\377\357\241\315\224Tr|\2405O\213\bB\217J\330I\nMB[\322U\'\332\362Y\214\r\234\304\201V\025\v\365\306\344\251"
