  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Tracing the Model\'s Rules**\n\nI\'m focusing intently on the continuous ribbon model, particularly the user\'s explicit rules regarding the border-radius calculations. Specifically, I\'m examining how the `tripStartIso` and `tripEndIso` variables are derived using the first and last stops\' arrival and departure dates. This seems fundamental to the ribbon\'s continuous nature and correct rendering.\n\n\n**Analyzing Date-Based Logic**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the date-specific rendering rules. It\'s clear that `tripStartIso` and `tripEndIso` are critical in determining the visual treatment of each date, whether it\'s a pill-shaped start, end, or a sharp-cornered rectangle in between. The solid end-caps are no longer needed. The specific rules for each date type, like rounding and color, are key.\n\n\n**Examining Date Overlaps**\n\nI\'m now focusing on date overlaps, particularly between stops like KUL and IST. I see the 21st of November is a key transition point. It\'s KUL\'s departure date, while IST\'s arrival is the next day. The overnight flights introduce complexities. I am tracing the implications of overlapping dates and how they affect the logic.\n\n\n**Investigating Ribbon Continuity**\n\nI\'m now deeply engaged in the implications of overnight transit gaps, specifically focusing on the November 21st scenario. Abandoning the prior focus on `tripEndIso`, I\'ve analyzed the logic around stops and dates and found a significant challenge: rendering a \"white hole\" on a day like Nov 21st would break the ribbon\'s continuous nature. I\'m exploring two cases. Case A clarifies same-day handoffs, and Case B describes overnight transitions.\n\n\n**Refining Overnight Transitions**\n\nI\'ve been working through the overnight transit logic, especially around the November 21st scenario. I\'m now testing the concept of treating dates that bridge the transit, like the 21st, as a flat, \"rounded-none\" split rectangle. The gradient would transition between the departure and arrival colors, with crisp white text. This approach aims to maintain the ribbon\'s visual continuity across the overnight transition. I\'m defining rules for different date types to clarify the implications of each.\n\n\n**Defining Date Transitions**\n\nI\'m now concretely defining the ribbon\'s visual transitions based on the trip\'s dates. I\'ve mapped specific rules: split rectangles for overnight flights, soft-tinted rectangles for regular nights, and solid end-caps for the start and end dates, as a continuous set from the left cap to the right cap. For example, November 30th is a split teal/purple rectangle.\n\n\n**Clarifying Visual Rules**\n\nI am now solidifying the visual rules. The left pill cap will strictly be on `tripStartIso` (Nov 18th) and the right pill cap will be on `tripEndIso` (Dec 4th). All intermediate days and handoff days will have sharp, `rounded-none` rectangles. There will be no intermediate solid end-caps. Regular stay nights will have soft tinted backgrounds with crisp dark text. Split-color, `rounded-none` rectangles with crisp white bold text will mark every handoff or transition day. I\'m now testing these concepts. The remaining question centers on the active stop highlight; `box-shadow` or top/bottom borders might provide the clean visual wrap needed.\n\n\n**Defining Active Stop Highlights**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on highlighting the active stop\'s visual treatment. I\'m focusing on regular nights within the active stop\'s span. I\'ve found a good approach: a soft tint in the active color and crisp inset top and bottom borders. On rectangular cells, these borders create a seamless, continuous accent bar. Even better, this style works smoothly at the `tripStartIso` and `tripEndIso` dates, removing any collisions!\n\n\n**Defining Draft Visuals**\n\nI\'m now solidifying the visuals during draft range selection. For the active stop, Nov 26 and Nov 30 remain sharp, split rectangles with the existing colors. I will now adjust the draft visuals. The middle of the stay, Nov 27, 28, and 29 will be `rounded-none`, and have richer purple tints, with crisp inset bars. The left and right are `rounded-l-full` and `rounded-r-full` when they\'re the trip start and end, respectively.\n\n\n**Testing Edge Cases**\n\nI\'m now focusing on edge cases, like when there\'s only one stop. In that scenario, `tripStartIso` and `tripEndIso` must never be the same. When the stop has a single night, the arrival date will be `rounded-l-full` and departure is `rounded-none`. The handoff date must be handled with a diagonal split.\n\n\n**Refining Ribbon Continuity**\n\nI\'m now refining the edge cases. I\'ve successfully visualized a 2-night stop: soft teal tints with dark text. The final date is rendered as a clean, rounded end. It still works without visual collisions. Next, I\'m analyzing a multi-day transit gap with a soft transit tint for intermediate days to maintain ribbon continuity. I\'m reviewing the edge cases with one-day gaps.\n\n\n**Verifying Overnight Transitions**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the crucial overnight transition from KUL to IST. The diagonal split on November 21st seamlessly connects the ribbon. However, the next day, November 22nd, should be rendered as IST\'s first regular night with a soft teal tint, maintaining the ribbon\'s smooth flow. This rule applies consistently; same-day handoffs get a split, and the next day is the arrival\'s regular night.\n\n\n\n**Confirming Date Logic**\n\nI\'ve just validated a continuous ribbon across the entire date range, from November 18th to December 4th, ensuring consistent rendering. The date logic aligns perfectly with all the visual rules. I can see that only the starting date gets a left pill cap, and only the end date gets a right pill cap. Regular nights get a soft background tint and crisp dark text, while transition days have flat, split-color rectangles with crisp white text.\n\n\n**Validating Seamless Rendering**\n\nI\'m now integrating the visual tweaks. I am removing cap spacing and confirming a seamless, continuous ribbon with zero gaps. I\'ve ensured a `gap-x-0` grid for horizontal joins. I\'m verifying the active stop highlight, using soft tints and inset borders. I also double-checked the color combinations.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6538448049136553776"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Refactor MultiDestDatePickerModal calendar grid into a continuous seamless horizontal ribbon with left/right caps only on trip start/end dates, sharp rectangles for intermediate nights, and split-color rectangles for handoff days\", \"EndLine\":422, \"Instruction\":\"Replace allocation mapping and calendar matrix cell rendering to implement the continuous ribbon border-radius rules, soft-tinted intermediate nights, and split-color transition rectangles\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const tripStartIso = stops[0]?.arrivalDate ?? null;\\n  const tripEndIso = stops[stops.length - 1]?.departureDate ?? null;\\n  const firstStopColor = stops[0] ? (stopColorMap[stops[0].id] ?? \'#FF812E\') : \'#FF812E\';\\n  const lastStopColor =\\n    stops[stops.length - 1]\\n      ? (stopColorMap[stops[stops.length - 1].id] ?? \'#D97706\')\\n      : \'#FF812E\';\\n\\n  // Map every calendar date inside [tripStartIso, tripEndIso] to either:\\n  // - a regular stay night (soft tinted rectangle), or\\n  // - a handoff/transition day (diagonal split-color rectangle between outgoing & incoming stops).\\n  const { stayDayMap, handoffDayMap, bridgeDaySet } = useMemo(() => {\\n    const stayMap: Record<string, { stop: TripStop; color: string }> = {};\\n    const handoffMap: Record<\\n      string,\\n      { outStop: TripStop; inStop: TripStop; outColor: string; inColor: string }\\n    > = {};\\n    const bridgeSet = new Set<string>();\\n\\n    for (let idx = 0; idx < stops.length; idx++) {\\n      const stop = stops[idx];\\n      const color = stopColorMap[stop.id] ?? \'#FF812E\';\\n      const nights = Math.max(1, diffDaysIso(stop.arrivalDate, stop.departureDate));\\n\\n      for (let n = 0; n < nights; n++) {\\n        const iso = addDaysIso(stop.arrivalDate, n);\\n        // Never overwrite tripStartIso or an earlier stop\'s night\\n        if (!stayMap[iso]) {\\n          stayMap[iso] = { stop, color };\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      // Transition / handoff day between stop[idx] and stop[idx + 1]\\n      if (idx < stops.length - 1) {\\n        const nextStop = stops[idx + 1];\\n        const nextColor = stopColorMap[nextStop.id] ?? \'#0D9488\';\\n        const depIso = stop.departureDate;\\n\\n        handoffMap[depIso] = {\\n          outStop: stop,\\n          inStop: nextStop,\\n          outColor: color,\\n          inColor: nextColor,\\n        };\\n\\n        // Fill any multi-day transit gap strictly between depIso and nextStop.arrivalDate\\n        const gapDays = diffDaysIso(depIso, nextStop.arrivalDate);\\n        for (let g = 1; g < gapDays; g++) {\\n          bridgeSet.add(addDaysIso(depIso, g));\\n        }\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    return { stayDayMap: stayMap, handoffDayMap: handoffMap, bridgeDaySet: bridgeSet };\\n  }, [stops, stopColorMap]);\\n\\n  if (!isOpen || stops.length === 0) return null;\\n\\n  const monthTitle = new Date(Date.UTC(viewMonth.year, viewMonth.month, 1)).toLocaleDateString(\\n    \'en-US\',\\n    { month: \'long\', year: \'numeric\', timeZone: \'UTC\' }\\n  );\\n\\n  const monthCells = getMonthGrid(viewMonth.year, viewMonth.month);\\n\\n  const shiftMonth = (delta: number) => {\\n    const dt = new Date(Date.UTC(viewMonth.year, viewMonth.month + delta, 1));\\n    setViewMonth({ year: dt.getUTCFullYear(), month: dt.getUTCMonth() });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSelectStopTab = (stop: TripStop) => {\\n    setSelectedStopId(stop.id);\\n    setDraftStartIso(null);\\n    setHoverIso(null);\\n    const dt = parseIsoUtc(stop.arrivalDate);\\n    setViewMonth({ year: dt.getUTCFullYear(), month: dt.getUTCMonth() });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDayClick = (iso: string) => {\\n    if (!activeStop) return;\\n    if (prevStopMinArrival && iso < prevStopMinArrival) return;\\n\\n    if (!draftStartIso) {\\n      // First click begins range selection for the active stop\\n      setDraftStartIso(iso);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (iso <= draftStartIso) {\\n      // Clicked same or earlier day: treat as 1-night stay starting on clicked date if same, else restart range\\n      if (iso === draftStartIso) {\\n        onUpdateStopDates(activeStop.id, iso, addDaysIso(iso, 1));\\n        setDraftStartIso(null);\\n        setHoverIso(null);\\n      } else {\\n        setDraftStartIso(iso);\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Second click sets departureDate (arrivalDate -> iso) and cascades subsequent stops\\n    onUpdateStopDates(activeStop.id, draftStartIso, iso);\\n    setDraftStartIso(null);\\n    setHoverIso(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Preview range while selecting second date\\n  const previewEndIso =\\n    draftStartIso && hoverIso && hoverIso > draftStartIso ? hoverIso : null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n      aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n      aria-label=\\\"Multi-destination trip date picker\\\"\\n      onClick={onClose}\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/25 backdrop-blur-xs\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div\\n        onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\\n        className=\\\"w-full max-w-lg bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\\\"\\n      >\\n        {/* Header */}\\n        <div className=\\\"px-5 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n            <span\\n              className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shrink-0\\\"\\n              style={{\\n                backgroundColor: `${activeColor}14`,\\n                borderColor: `${activeColor}45`,\\n                color: activeColor,\\n              }}\\n            >\\n              <Calendar className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </span>\\n            <div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-base font-bold text-[#111827]\\\">\\n                Itinerary Dates\\n              </h2>\\n              {activeStop && (\\n                <div className=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-[#4B5563] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  {activeStop.city}: {formatShortDate(activeStop.arrivalDate)} \342\206\222{\' \'}\\n                  {formatShortDate(activeStop.departureDate)} ({activeStop.stayNights}n)\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Close calendar\\\"\\n            onClick={onClose}\\n            className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors cursor-pointer shrink-0\\\"\\n          >\\n            <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Active Stop Selector Tabs (wrapping cleanly without horizontal clipping) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"px-5 pt-3.5 pb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          {stops.map((stop, idx) => {\\n            const isSelected = stop.id === activeStop?.id;\\n            const color = stopColorMap[stop.id] ?? \'#FF812E\';\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={stop.id}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => handleSelectStopTab(stop)}\\n                style={\\n                  isSelected\\n                    ? {\\n                        borderColor: color,\\n                        backgroundColor: `${color}14`,\\n                      }\\n                    : undefined\\n                }\\n                className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                  isSelected\\n                    ? \'font-bold text-[#111827] shadow-xs\'\\n                    : \'font-medium bg-white border-slate-200/80 text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:border-slate-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span\\n                  className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0\\\"\\n                  style={{ backgroundColor: color }}\\n                />\\n                <span>\\n                  {idx + 1}. {stop.city}\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#4B5563] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  {stop.stayNights}n\\n                </span>\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Calendar Month Navigation & Grid */}\\n        <div className=\\\"px-5 py-3 space-y-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Previous month\\\"\\n              onClick={() => shiftMonth(-1)}\\n              className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-center text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ChevronLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <h3 className=\\\"font-display text-sm font-bold text-[#111827]\\\">\\n              {monthTitle}\\n            </h3>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Next month\\\"\\n              onClick={() => shiftMonth(1)}\\n              className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-center text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Weekday Headers */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 text-center\\\">\\n            {WEEKDAYS.map((day) => (\\n              <div\\n                key={day}\\n                className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#4B5563] py-1\\\"\\n              >\\n                {day}\\n              </div>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* 42-Day Calendar Matrix (Continuous Seamless Ribbon) */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-x-0 gap-y-1.5\\\">\\n            {monthCells.map(({ iso, inMonth }) => {\\n              const dayNum = Number(iso.slice(-2));\\n              const stay = stayDayMap[iso];\\n              const handoff = handoffDayMap[iso];\\n              const isBridge = bridgeDaySet.has(iso);\\n              const isTripStart = tripStartIso !== null && iso === tripStartIso;\\n              const isTripEnd = tripEndIso !== null && iso === tripEndIso;\\n              const isBeforePrevStop =\\n                prevStopMinArrival !== null && iso < prevStopMinArrival;\\n\\n              const isDraftStart = draftStartIso === iso;\\n              const isInDraftPreview =\\n                draftStartIso !== null &&\\n                previewEndIso !== null &&\\n                iso > draftStartIso &&\\n                iso < previewEndIso;\\n              const isDraftEnd = previewEndIso === iso;\\n              const isAnyDraft = isDraftStart || isInDraftPreview || isDraftEnd;\\n\\n              let bgStyle: string | undefined;\\n              let bgImageStyle: string | undefined;\\n              let textColor = inMonth ? \'#111827\' : \'#9CA3AF\';\\n              let radiusClass = \'rounded-none\';\\n              let boxShadowStyle: string | undefined;\\n              let fontWeightClass = \'font-medium\';\\n\\n              if (isAnyDraft) {\\n                if (isDraftStart) {\\n                  bgStyle = activeColor;\\n                  textColor = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n                  fontWeightClass = \'font-bold\';\\n                  radiusClass =\\n                    activeStopIndex === 0 ? \'rounded-l-full rounded-r-none\' : \'rounded-none\';\\n                } else if (isDraftEnd) {\\n                  bgStyle = activeColor;\\n                  textColor = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n                  fontWeightClass = \'font-bold\';\\n                  radiusClass =\\n                    activeStopIndex === stops.length - 1\\n                      ? \'rounded-r-full rounded-l-none\'\\n                      : \'rounded-none\';\\n                } else {\\n                  bgStyle = `${activeColor}26`;\\n                  textColor = \'#111827\';\\n                  fontWeightClass = \'font-semibold\';\\n                  radiusClass = \'rounded-none\';\\n                  boxShadowStyle = `inset 0 2px 0 0 ${activeColor}, inset 0 -2px 0 0 ${activeColor}`;\\n                }\\n              } else if (isTripStart) {\\n                // Trip Start Date ONLY: solid pill cap rounded only on the left\\n                bgStyle = firstStopColor;\\n                textColor = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n                fontWeightClass = \'font-bold\';\\n                radiusClass = \'rounded-l-full rounded-r-none\';\\n              } else if (isTripEnd) {\\n                // Trip End Date ONLY: solid pill cap rounded only on the right\\n                bgStyle = lastStopColor;\\n                textColor = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n                fontWeightClass = \'font-bold\';\\n                radiusClass = \'rounded-r-full rounded-l-none\';\\n              } else if (handoff) {\\n                // Handoff/Transition Day: flat rectangle split diagonally between outgoing and incoming colors\\n                bgImageStyle = `linear-gradient(135deg, ${handoff.outColor} 49%, ${handoff.inColor} 51%)`;\\n                textColor = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n                fontWeightClass = \'font-semibold\';\\n                radiusClass = \'rounded-none\';\\n              } else if (stay) {\\n                // Intermediate Night: flat sharp-cornered rectangle with soft tinted background & dark text\\n                const isActiveStopDay = stay.stop.id === activeStop?.id;\\n                bgStyle = isActiveStopDay ? `${stay.color}26` : `${stay.color}16`;\\n                textColor = \'#111827\';\\n                fontWeightClass = isActiveStopDay ? \'font-semibold\' : \'font-medium\';\\n                radiusClass = \'rounded-none\';\\n                if (isActiveStopDay) {\\n                  boxShadowStyle = `inset 0 2px 0 0 ${stay.color}, inset 0 -2px 0 0 ${stay.color}`;\\n                }\\n              } else if (isBridge) {\\n                bgStyle = \'#F1F5F9\';\\n                textColor = \'#475569\';\\n                radiusClass = \'rounded-none\';\\n              }\\n\\n              const tooltipText =\\n                isBeforePrevStop && prevStopMinArrival\\n                  ? `Available from ${formatShortDate(prevStopMinArrival)}`\\n                  : handoff\\n                    ? `${handoff.outStop.city} \342\206\222 ${handoff.inStop.city} (${iso})`\\n                    : isTripEnd && stops[stops.length - 1]\\n                      ? `${stops[stops.length - 1].city} departure (${iso})`\\n                      : stay\\n                        ? `${stay.stop.city} (${stay.stop.arrivalDate} \342\206\222 ${stay.stop.departureDate})`\\n                        : iso;\\n\\n              return (\\n                <button\\n                  key={iso}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  disabled={isBeforePrevStop}\\n                  onMouseEnter={() => {\\n                    if (draftStartIso && !isBeforePrevStop) setHoverIso(iso);\\n                  }}\\n                  onClick={() => handleDayClick(iso)}\\n                  title={tooltipText}\\n                  style={{\\n                    backgroundColor: bgStyle,\\n                    backgroundImage: bgImageStyle,\\n                    color: textColor,\\n                    boxShadow: boxShadowStyle,\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`relative h-9 flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs tabular-nums transition-colors ${\\n                    isBeforePrevStop ? \'cursor-not-allowed\' : \'cursor-pointer\'\\n                  } ${fontWeightClass} ${radiusClass} ${\\n                    !bgStyle && !bgImageStyle && !isBeforePrevStop\\n                      ? \'hover:bg-slate-100 rounded-md\'\\n                      : \'\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {dayNum}\\n                </button>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\", \"StartLine\":91, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Map each ISO day to the stop whose booked nights cover that date [arrivalDate, departureDate)\\n  // plus any departing stop checking out on the same day for clean split-pill handoff rendering.\\n  const { dayAllocationMap, checkoutColorByIso } = useMemo(() => {\\n    const map: Record<\\n      string,\\n      {\\n        stop: TripStop;\\n        color: string;\\n        isStart: boolean;\\n        isEndNight: boolean;\\n      }\\n    > = {};\\n    const checkouts: Record<string, string> = {};\\n\\n    for (const stop of stops) {\\n      const color = stopColorMap[stop.id] ?? \'#FF812E\';\\n      checkouts[stop.departureDate] = color;\\n\\n      const nights = Math.max(1, diffDaysIso(stop.arrivalDate, stop.departureDate));\\n      for (let n = 0; n < nights; n++) {\\n        const iso = addDaysIso(stop.arrivalDate, n);\\n        map[iso] = {\\n          stop,\\n          color,\\n          isStart: n === 0,\\n          isEndNight: n === nights - 1,\\n        };\\n      }\\n    }\\n    return { dayAllocationMap: map, checkoutColorByIso: checkouts };\\n  }, [stops, stopColorMap]);\\n\\n  if (!isOpen || stops.length === 0) return null;\\n\\n  const monthTitle = new Date(Date.UTC(viewMonth.year, viewMonth.month, 1)).toLocaleDateString(\\n    \'en-US\',\\n    { month: \'long\', year: \'numeric\', timeZone: \'UTC\' }\\n  );\\n\\n  const monthCells = getMonthGrid(viewMonth.year, viewMonth.month);\\n\\n  const shiftMonth = (delta: number) => {\\n    const dt = new Date(Date.UTC(viewMonth.year, viewMonth.month + delta, 1));\\n    setViewMonth({ year: dt.getUTCFullYear(), month: dt.getUTCMonth() });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleSelectStopTab = (stop: TripStop) => {\\n    setSelectedStopId(stop.id);\\n    setDraftStartIso(null);\\n    setHoverIso(null);\\n    const dt = parseIsoUtc(stop.arrivalDate);\\n    setViewMonth({ year: dt.getUTCFullYear(), month: dt.getUTCMonth() });\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleDayClick = (iso: string) => {\\n    if (!activeStop) return;\\n    if (prevStopMinArrival && iso < prevStopMinArrival) return;\\n\\n    if (!draftStartIso) {\\n      // First click begins range selection for the active stop\\n      setDraftStartIso(iso);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    if (iso <= draftStartIso) {\\n      // Clicked same or earlier day: treat as 1-night stay starting on clicked date if same, else restart range\\n      if (iso === draftStartIso) {\\n        onUpdateStopDates(activeStop.id, iso, addDaysIso(iso, 1));\\n        setDraftStartIso(null);\\n        setHoverIso(null);\\n      } else {\\n        setDraftStartIso(iso);\\n      }\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Second click sets departureDate (arrivalDate -> iso) and cascades subsequent stops\\n    onUpdateStopDates(activeStop.id, draftStartIso, iso);\\n    setDraftStartIso(null);\\n    setHoverIso(null);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Preview range while selecting second date\\n  const previewEndIso =\\n    draftStartIso && hoverIso && hoverIso > draftStartIso ? hoverIso : null;\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div\\n      role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n      aria-modal=\\\"true\\\"\\n      aria-label=\\\"Multi-destination trip date picker\\\"\\n      onClick={onClose}\\n      className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/25 backdrop-blur-xs\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div\\n        onClick={(e) => e.stopPropagation()}\\n        className=\\\"w-full max-w-lg bg-white border border-slate-200/80 shadow-xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\\\"\\n      >\\n        {/* Header */}\\n        <div className=\\\"px-5 py-4 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n            <span\\n              className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl border flex items-center justify-center transition-colors shrink-0\\\"\\n              style={{\\n                backgroundColor: `${activeColor}14`,\\n                borderColor: `${activeColor}45`,\\n                color: activeColor,\\n              }}\\n            >\\n              <Calendar className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </span>\\n            <div>\\n              <h2 className=\\\"font-display text-base font-bold text-[#111827]\\\">\\n                Itinerary Dates\\n              </h2>\\n              {activeStop && (\\n                <div className=\\\"text-xs font-mono text-[#4B5563] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  {activeStop.city}: {formatShortDate(activeStop.arrivalDate)} \342\206\222{\' \'}\\n                  {formatShortDate(activeStop.departureDate)} ({activeStop.stayNights}n)\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <button\\n            type=\\\"button\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Close calendar\\\"\\n            onClick={onClose}\\n            className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors cursor-pointer shrink-0\\\"\\n          >\\n            <X className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Active Stop Selector Tabs (wrapping cleanly without horizontal clipping) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"px-5 pt-3.5 pb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          {stops.map((stop, idx) => {\\n            const isSelected = stop.id === activeStop?.id;\\n            const color = stopColorMap[stop.id] ?? \'#FF812E\';\\n            return (\\n              <button\\n                key={stop.id}\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={() => handleSelectStopTab(stop)}\\n                style={\\n                  isSelected\\n                    ? {\\n                        borderColor: color,\\n                        backgroundColor: `${color}14`,\\n                      }\\n                    : undefined\\n                }\\n                className={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 border transition-all cursor-pointer ${\\n                  isSelected\\n                    ? \'font-bold text-[#111827] shadow-xs\'\\n                    : \'font-medium bg-white border-slate-200/80 text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:border-slate-300\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <span\\n                  className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full shrink-0\\\"\\n                  style={{ backgroundColor: color }}\\n                />\\n                <span>\\n                  {idx + 1}. {stop.city}\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[11px] text-[#4B5563] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  {stop.stayNights}n\\n                </span>\\n              </button>\\n            );\\n          })}\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Calendar Month Navigation & Grid */}\\n        <div className=\\\"px-5 py-3 space-y-3\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Previous month\\\"\\n              onClick={() => shiftMonth(-1)}\\n              className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-center text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ChevronLeft className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n\\n            <h3 className=\\\"font-display text-sm font-bold text-[#111827]\\\">\\n              {monthTitle}\\n            </h3>\\n\\n            <button\\n              type=\\\"button\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Next month\\\"\\n              onClick={() => shiftMonth(1)}\\n              className=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/80 flex items-center justify-center text-[#4B5563] hover:text-[#111827] hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ChevronRight className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Weekday Headers */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-1 text-center\\\">\\n            {WEEKDAYS.map((day) => (\\n              <div\\n                key={day}\\n                className=\\\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#4B5563] py-1\\\"\\n              >\\n                {day}\\n              </div>\\n            ))}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* 42-Day Calendar Matrix */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-7 gap-y-1.5\\\">\\n            {monthCells.map(({ iso, inMonth }) => {\\n              const dayNum = Number(iso.slice(-2));\\n              const alloc = dayAllocationMap[iso];\\n              const isBeforePrevStop =\\n                prevStopMinArrival !== null && iso < prevStopMinArrival;\\n              const isDraftStart = draftStartIso === iso;\\n              const isInDraftPreview =\\n                draftStartIso !== null &&\\n                previewEndIso !== null &&\\n                iso >= draftStartIso &&\\n                iso < previewEndIso;\\n              const isDraftEnd = previewEndIso === iso;\\n              const isActiveCheckout =\\n                !draftStartIso && activeStop?.departureDate === iso;\\n              const departingColor = checkoutColorByIso[iso];\\n              const isSameDayHandoff = Boolean(\\n                alloc && alloc.isStart && departingColor && departingColor !== alloc.color\\n              );\\n\\n              let bgStyle: string | undefined;\\n              let bgImageStyle: string | undefined;\\n              let textColor = inMonth ? \'#111827\' : \'#9CA3AF\';\\n              let pillRadius = \'rounded-full\';\\n              let boxShadowStyle: string | undefined;\\n              let fontWeightClass = \'font-medium\';\\n              let capSpacingClass = \'\';\\n\\n              if (isDraftStart || isInDraftPreview || isDraftEnd) {\\n                bgStyle =\\n                  isDraftStart || isDraftEnd ? activeColor : `${activeColor}1F`;\\n                textColor =\\n                  isDraftStart || isDraftEnd ? \'#FFFFFF\' : \'#111827\';\\n                fontWeightClass =\\n                  isDraftStart || isDraftEnd ? \'font-bold\' : \'font-semibold\';\\n                if (isDraftStart && previewEndIso) pillRadius = \'rounded-l-full\';\\n                else if (isDraftEnd) pillRadius = \'rounded-r-full\';\\n                else if (isInDraftPreview) pillRadius = \'rounded-none\';\\n\\n                if (isDraftStart || isDraftEnd) {\\n                  boxShadowStyle = `0 0 0 1.5px #FFFFFF, 0 0 0 3px ${activeColor}`;\\n                }\\n              } else if (alloc) {\\n                const isActiveStopDay = alloc.stop.id === activeStop?.id;\\n                if (alloc.isStart || alloc.isEndNight) {\\n                  if (isSameDayHandoff && departingColor) {\\n                    bgImageStyle = `linear-gradient(135deg, ${departingColor} 49%, ${alloc.color} 51%)`;\\n                  } else {\\n                    bgStyle = alloc.color;\\n                  }\\n                  textColor = \'#FFFFFF\';\\n                  fontWeightClass = isActiveStopDay ? \'font-bold\' : \'font-semibold\';\\n                  if (isActiveStopDay) {\\n                    boxShadowStyle = `0 0 0 1.5px #FFFFFF, 0 0 0 3px ${alloc.color}`;\\n                  }\\n                  if (alloc.isStart) capSpacingClass = \'ml-[2px]\';\\n                  if (alloc.isEndNight) capSpacingClass = `${capSpacingClass} mr-[2px]`.trim();\\n                } else {\\n                  bgStyle = isActiveStopDay ? `${alloc.color}24` : `${alloc.color}16`;\\n                  textColor = \'#111827\';\\n                  fontWeightClass = isActiveStopDay ? \'font-semibold\' : \'font-medium\';\\n                }\\n\\n                if (alloc.isStart && alloc.isEndNight) {\\n                  pillRadius = \'rounded-full\';\\n                } else if (alloc.isStart) {\\n                  pillRadius = \'rounded-l-full\';\\n                } else if (alloc.isEndNight) {\\n                  pillRadius = \'rounded-r-full\';\\n                } else {\\n                  pillRadius = \'rounded-none\';\\n                }\\n              }\\n\\n              if (isActiveCheckout && !alloc && !isDraftStart && !isInDraftPreview && !isDraftEnd) {\\n                boxShadowStyle = `inset 0 0 0 1.5px ${activeColor}`;\\n                textColor = activeColor;\\n                fontWeightClass = \'font-semibold\';\\n              }\\n\\n              return (\\n                <button\\n                  key={iso}\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  disabled={isBeforePrevStop}\\n                  onMouseEnter={() => {\\n                    if (draftStartIso && !isBeforePrevStop) setHoverIso(iso);\\n                  }}\\n                  onClick={() => handleDayClick(iso)}\\n                  title={\\n                    isBeforePrevStop && prevStopMinArrival\\n                      ? `Available from ${formatShortDate(prevStopMinArrival)}`\\n                      : alloc\\n                        ? `${alloc.stop.city} (${alloc.stop.arrivalDate} \342\206\222 ${alloc.stop.departureDate})`\\n                        : iso\\n                  }\\n                  style={{\\n                    backgroundColor: bgStyle,\\n                    backgroundImage: bgImageStyle,\\n                    color: textColor,\\n                    boxShadow: boxShadowStyle,\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`relative h-9 flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-xs tabular-nums transition-all ${\\n                    isBeforePrevStop\\n                      ? \'cursor-not-allowed opacity-85\'\\n                      : \'cursor-pointer\'\\n                  } ${\\n                    (isDraftStart || isDraftEnd || (alloc && alloc.stop.id === activeStop?.id && (alloc.isStart || alloc.isEndNight)))\\n                      ? \'z-10\'\\n                      : \'\'\\n                  } ${fontWeightClass} ${pillRadius} ${capSpacingClass} ${\\n                    !bgStyle && !bgImageStyle && !isBeforePrevStop ? \'hover:bg-slate-100\' : \'\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {dayNum}\\n                </button>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/MultiDestDatePickerModal.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Refactoring calendar into continuous ribbon\", \"toolSummary\":\"Refactor calendar ribbon rendering\"}"
