    response: "Refactored the **Itinerary Dates** calendar grid in `MultiDestDatePickerModal` into one continuous, seamless horizontal ribbon:\n\n- **Start & End Caps Only:** Rendered `rounded-l-full rounded-r-none` exclusively on the trip\'s first `arrivalDate` (`tripStartIso`) in the first stop\'s color and `rounded-r-full rounded-l-none` exclusively on the trip\'s final `departureDate` (`tripEndIso`) in the last stop\'s color.\n- **Sharp Rectangular Middle Nights:** Removed all intermediate solid end-caps and horizontal cell gaps (`gap-x-0`), rendering every intermediate night strictly as a flat `rounded-none` rectangle with a soft tinted fill in that stop\'s color and dark `#111827` text. Active stop selection uses crisp top/bottom inset bars (`inset 0 2px / 0 -2px`) with zero rounded curves on middle days.\n- **Diagonal Split-Color Handoff Rectangles:** Rendered transition/checkout dates between consecutive stops as flat `rounded-none` rectangles split diagonally (`linear-gradient(135deg, outColor 49%, inColor 51%)`) with centered white text.\n\n**Verification:** `npm run build` (`compile_applet`) and `tsc --noEmit` (`lint_applet`) passed with zero errors, and the dev server was restarted."
